description = "When an enemy comes within {e0.activation_radius}, the ally with the highest Max HP within {e0.ally_radius} gains [shield]+{e0.armor_bonus} armor[/shield] for {e0.duration}s and [cc]taunts every enemy[/cc] to attack it."
